llah, and guidance for believers during times of challenge. It also reflects on the significance of sincerity, discipline, and reliance on Allah for success.", "short_description": "Surah Al-Anfal discusses important lessons related to faith, unity, trust in Allah, and guidance for believers during times of challenge. It also reflects on the significance of sincerity, discipline, and reliance on Allah for success."}]}, "developer_name": "Miracle Group", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://miraclegroup.work/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Miracle Group", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.miraclegroup.work/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26774836518768382"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819982_905134869056548_5000700394762618496_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EPumnAuDNgcQ7kNvwFEZ-Fx&_nc_oc=Adp8OjkmouL1VPE3wRhr-K3AHMaEyEAGlEpDXsgHBVwwXgz4kL11iuDkftgPmhWiaUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRk3Gxn3yD0NHbIxrnAkeWRmL-GzXvrF47cC3z3W51QSA&oe=6B047EF6"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Surah Al-Anfal", "platform": "AND